        <mxCell id="points" value="&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:16px&quot;&gt;• AI can support target selection and candidate design.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:16px&quot;&gt;• Rentosertib has a published phase 2a IPF trial.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:16px&quot;&gt;• That study involved 71 patients and a 12-week treatment period.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:16px&quot;&gt;• Its primary objective was safety and tolerability; broader benefit needs further evidence.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#eff6ff;fontSize=24;" vertex="1" parent="1">
