        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="caption" value="Original explanatory adaptation of Liu’s repository perspective, pp. 3–6; a research agenda, not an established validated system." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;fontSize=19;fontColor=#aab7c6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
